# Claude instructions (project workspace)

This directory is the **same project workspace** as described in **`AGENTS.md`**
(root of **`~/dev/projects/___PROJECT___/`**). **Read and follow `AGENTS.md`**
for layout, version control (jj vs git), task workflow, and branch naming;
that file is the canonical rule set for this tree.

**`AGENTS.md`** also explains per-task checkouts under **`<type>/<task-id>/`**.
If a repo root contains its own **`AGENTS.md`** or **`CLAUDE.md`**, apply it
together with this file and the project-root **`AGENTS.md`**.

---

Further reading: `docs/project-task-workspaces.md` in your dotfiles repository.
